      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-Factor Authentication"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发布地址尚未配置，暂不能检查更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The release location isn’t configured yet, so updates can’t be checked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清理 IPA Depot 自己的缓存，不影响 ipatool 的组件缓存与登录状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only IPA Depot’s own cache is cleared. ipatool’s component cache and sign-in are not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清除记录，不会删除已下载的安装包文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the history is cleared. Downloaded IPA files are not deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "向 Apple 查询需要一点时间，通常在 30 秒内完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asking Apple takes a moment, usually less than 30 seconds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "商店地区跟随账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Store Region Follows Your Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图标缓存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icon Cache"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在搜索页点「下载最新版」，或在历史版本里选择一个版本下载。任务会依次进行，同一时间只下载一个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Download Latest” in Search, or pick a version under Older Versions. Downloads run one at a time, in order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "基于 majd/ipatool（MIT）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built on majd/ipatool (MIT)"
