    "密码只在本机使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password stays on this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码只用于在这台 Mac 上向 Apple 登录，不会上传到其他任何地方，IPA Depot 也不会保存它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password is only used to sign in to Apple from this Mac. It is never uploaded anywhere else, and IPA Depot does not store it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未登录": {
      "localizations": {
